    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>h</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, So minimum at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, So maximum at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http:/